Package: SpectraWeaveR
Title: End-to-End Pipeline for 40-Color Spectral Flow Cytometry Analysis
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: 
    person("SpectraWeaveR", "Authors", email = "spectraweaver@example.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Provides a complete, reproducible R pipeline for spectral flow
    cytometry data analysis from spectral unmixing through clustering. The
    pipeline integrates AutoSpectral (unmixing), openCyto (automated gating),
    PeacoQC (signal quality control), cyCombine (batch correction), and
    kohonen SOM or FastPG (clustering). Format conversion utilities handle
    transitions between flowFrame, GatingSet, tibble, and matrix objects
    required by each tool. Designed for Cytek Aurora 40-color single panels
    processed across multiple batches, following the validated workflow
    described in den Braanker et al. (2021) and Quintelier et al. (2021,
    Nature Protocols).
